{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two the Top is a cooperative precision platformer where the only obstacle is falling. Bring a friend along and work together as you brave the heights on your journey to the top! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple-to-learn controls. (Left, Right, Jump, Yoyo)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through many different environments with their own unique challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch your step, a fall could lose you a lot of progress!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a break at any time, the game will remember exactly where you last left off and will put you back on track when you return!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Invite a friend along to join for free using the friend pass! Only <u>ONE</u>\u00a0player needs to own the game to unlock the full experience! </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>(If both players are using the friend pass, you'll only have access to the demo portion of the game.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/DoItTogetherStorePasge.png?t=1749491818\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/TwoTheTopWorkTogetherGif.gif?t=1749491818\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A journey for two;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bounce off your partner's head to boost high up into the air, and let down your yoyo to let them climb up after you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/ATrueChallenge.png?t=1749491818\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/TwoTheTopChallenge.gif?t=1749491818\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nail-Biting, High-Stakes Level Design</strong>\u00a0where every jump is meaningful and holds weight; each fall is an opportunity to learn and improve. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/AWarningStorePage.png?t=1749491818\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/AWarningGifFinal.gif?t=1749491818\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a tough experience that's not for everyone; this game can be brutally punishing but greatly rewarding as well. If that isn't for you, you might want to pass on this one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, if you persist, you might find something you love.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>So...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you both make it to the top?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3525360?t=1749491818","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3525360?t=1749491818","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/abc4b9f14f35d5b0cdcaf89b3a1cdf4d9b2ef546/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749491818","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/abc4b9f14f35d5b0cdcaf89b3a1cdf4d9b2ef546/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749491818","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3666270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two the Top is a cooperative precision platformer where the only obstacle is falling. Bring a friend along and work together as you brave the heights on your journey to the top! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple-to-learn controls. (Left, Right, Jump, Yoyo)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through many different environments with their own unique challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch your step, a fall could lose you a lot of progress!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a break at any time, the game will remember exactly where you last left off and will put you back on track when you return!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Invite a friend along to join for free using the friend pass! Only <u>ONE</u>\u00a0player needs to own the game to unlock the full experience! </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>(If both players are using the friend pass, you'll only have access to the demo portion of the game.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/DoItTogetherStorePasge.png?t=1749491818\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/TwoTheTopWorkTogetherGif.gif?t=1749491818\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A journey for two;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bounce off your partner's head to boost high up into the air, and let down your yoyo to let them climb up after you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/ATrueChallenge.png?t=1749491818\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/TwoTheTopChallenge.gif?t=1749491818\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nail-Biting, High-Stakes Level Design</strong>\u00a0where every jump is meaningful and holds weight; each fall is an opportunity to learn and improve. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/AWarningStorePage.png?t=1749491818\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/extras/AWarningGifFinal.gif?t=1749491818\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a tough experience that's not for everyone; this game can be brutally punishing but greatly rewarding as well. If that isn't for you, you might want to pass on this one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, if you persist, you might find something you love.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>So...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you both make it to the top?</p>","developers":["James Sutton"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525360/1c5e786ee2753ccbc277d24375e2b7d09516a629/header.jpg?t=1749491818","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257132987,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132987/movie480.mp4?t=1749491816","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132987/movie_max.mp4?t=1749491816"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257132987/a8f1653fa20d427670daf5a8e59410f9c0c15429/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749491816","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132987/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749491816","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132987/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749491816"}}],"name":"Two the Top","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<str